{
  "rule": "A quantitative authoritative field is not considered mechanically complete until a deterministic runtime consumer exists. Presentation-only labels may describe derived state but may never create or modify mechanical state.",
  "global_invariants": [
    "no narrator-created people",
    "no narrator-created money",
    "no narrator-created equipment or materials",
    "no narrator-created crops, herbs, medicine or pills",
    "no free building or enterprise level",
    "no free training or aptitude change",
    "no random candidate reroll",
    "no random crafting quality or crafting success",
    "no random route duration",
    "same world seed plus place plus six-hour block yields the same weather",
    "martial faction deployments conserve exact faction members",
    "government ordinary soldiers remain aggregate exact headcounts",
    "capability stats are uncapped; aptitude is bounded 0 through 200",
    "item hardware remains physically bounded even when character capability exceeds 200",
    "all martial-faction population counts reconcile to persistent Person Lite or Full Character identities",
    "civilian markets have finite saved stock and production; no infinite shop inventory",
    "paid contracts require escrowed issuer funding before acceptance",
    "medicine dose use decrements exact inventory before effect application",
    "medicine saturation, toxicity and active effects settle from exact elapsed time",
    "public reputation and rankings cannot consume hidden true stats or undelivered events",
    "autonomous world work is classified as internal, soft player-facing or hard decision before event-seeking time stops",
    "there is no mercenary-company faction type or mercenary-contract enterprise type in the Jianghu ruleset",
    "personal combat health authority is anatomy, blood loss, pain, shock, consciousness and function; no hit-point pool",
    "direct Qi-restoration/cultivation pills do not exist; Qi recovery comes from elapsed rest/health/Qi Control and growth comes from cultivation/training",
    "faction stock is owned by exact faction inventory owners; coarse equipment/material/medicine counts on faction records are forbidden"
  ],
